Package: conformeR
Type: Package
Title: Conformalized differential expression analysis of multi-condition single-cell data
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(person(given="Justine", family="Leclerc", email="justine.leclerc@usz.ch", role = c("cre", "aut"),
